ストを描いてくださりありがとうございました！今度は、好きな絵師さんの気に入ってるこのキャラクターを描いてもらえますか？(本人には許可を貰ってます)\n\nキャラクター名 \"mazarine\" (31歳、男性)\n\n資料: https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1kklF5La2hpkGhV9dVGfSy9IdUE_b_zBM\n\nとある事件で右腕を失ってしまい、それ以降少しやさぐれ気味になってしまった医師。タバコをよく吸う。基本はぶっきらぼうで少し冷淡だが、面倒見がいいところもあり。(また、仲間や小さな子供に対しては優しい一面を見せる事がある。)\n\n背景の色は水色、または青色系統にしてもらえると嬉しいです！あと、\"mazarine\"の目の傷は右目にあるので間違えないように気をつけてください！", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@modaesinisou/works/4", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1181192, "client_id": 2919110, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/f80995c3/uploads/origins/06e76459-8faa-4691-b605-27fd9b957510?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=80cb2233c25c9ed30774f0c06a2f0cdf", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/f80995c3/uploads/origins/06e76459-8faa-4691-b605-27fd9b957510?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a242155d40cc89dfcb153f07d6d549fe", "src_set": ""}, "body": "₹よɭ ɿ ㄘㄑƕ🧢さん、はじめまして。絵柄がとってもかわいくて好みです。\n今回は可能であればVライバー + 派生を2人お願いしたいです。\n\n使用用途 : SNS、（可能であれば）ネットプリントでの配布\n\nそぼろ忍\n・伊賀の忍者ですが、世界観は現代です。\n・おぼろ忍のことが嫌いです。\n・おぼろ忍より弱いです。\n・普段はドラゴン形態ですが、人間に変化できます。\n・衣装・ポーズなどはすべてお任せします。\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1mqMPGffnjBeCSnHpGbeBjfpiXVVtEZRx?usp=drive_link\n\nおぼろ忍\n・甲賀の忍者です。他はそぼろ忍とほぼ同じです。\n・そぼろ忍にあまり興味がありません。\n・そぼろ忍より強いですが、基本何も考えていません。\n・普段はドラゴン形態ですが、人間に変化できます。\n・衣装・ポーズなどはすべてお任せします。\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1DPZZqHfZB2Mqp5AqZUfS0oyPNVYdDaMS?usp=drive_link\n\nもし金額的に片方しか難しいようでしたら、お好きなほうを描いていただければと思います。\nリクエストに問題などあればキャンセルしていただいて構いません。\nお手数をおかけしますが、よろしくお願いいたします。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1hNdATliu44q5zqIKHfyODWRggHNnO6pd?usp=drive_link\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1hNdATliu44q5zqIKHfyODWRggHNnO6pd?usp=drive_link", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@modaesinisou/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1181192, "client_id": 3073385, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b67197df/uploads/origins/80cefdd2-858d-49c6-89f3-42222de7fe46?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4b415aa335e2ef67b119459ea8b2caf3", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b67197df/uploads/origins/80cefdd2-858d-49c6-89f3-42222de7fe46?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=4cceaf0920d544961d88c0c4eec4bbb6", "src_set": ""}, "body": "₹よɭ ɿ ㄘㄑƕ🧢様初めまして！\nいつも素敵なイラスト拝見させております…！\n是非自創作キャラ2人をリクエストさせて頂きたいです！\n\n服装や構図についてはお任せしますのでお好きに描いて頂ければと思います\nヘアアレンジなども大歓迎です◎\n\n自分用にアクリル系のグッズにしたいと考えているので宛名やサイン､背景などはレイヤーなどでon/off出来る又は､透過版を頂けると助かります…！\n\nご検討の程よろしくお願い致します\n不備などございましたらお気軽にキャンセルや再送などして頂けますと幸いです！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-B8tU0sip0mw5fpkhwiJaLBBJvEP0COF", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@modaesinisou/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1181192, "client_id": 3116476, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/50ad3b85/uploads/origins/3da00664-d073-47e8-adfc-6547674e9c53?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cd94bc6e2fa91c342162b19b371ff708", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/50ad3b85/uploads/origins/3da00664-d073-47e8-adfc-6547674e9c53?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c3dc04998700c6644f824cc63b733c0d", "src_set": ""}, "body": "Nice to meet you, Mr. Kiyochiku. Please excuse my request. If it is possible, could you draw an illustration of my character and my friend's character \"Uchiyo\"?\n\nCharacters I would like you to draw\nTell, the red devil child\n(My character)\nSelf-centered and arrogant. He is about 30cm in size.\nHe is often annoyed by the following child, and is often irritated by him.\n\nHade, a scientist kid who wears goggles.\n(Friend's character).\nHe is usually friendly and talkative, but in his true nature he is a cruel person and the leader of a group of mad scientists.\nHe is quite fond of the above-mentioned boy and has recently made it a hobby to tease him.\n\nLinks to resources\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-0iLDVkvVmQXqx7Wu9C9ASj5gncskZS-\n\n(I would also like to make a keychain as a hobby, so it would be great if you could make a character-only version without the background)", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@modaesinisou/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1181192, "client_id": 2010848, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/394e216d/uploads/origins/4bc716c5-6abb-4753-9551-b1c85f377e80?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=370e361ad867de389029d7336f2c48fb", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/394e216d/uploads/origins/4bc716c5-6abb-4753-9551-b1c85f377e80?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=4b651dc1c7b2a7f59a96d40a3aee85c5", "src_set": ""}, "body": "Dear ₹yoɭ ɿ ㄘㄑƕ, nice to meet you! Now I would like to ask you to draw these girls!\n\nSakura (red hair) 188cm: a witch picked her up and raised her. She is an unkind servant and a knight. She watches over the witch like a bad dog protecting her master.\nLuna (blue hair) 143cm: She is an immortal moon witch. She is an unsociable attendant, lazy. Loves romance. She is as mysterious as the moon.\n\nI will leave everything to you, including composition, so please feel free to draw what you see in the material or not.\nIf it is difficult for you to accept or the amount of money, I would like to ask you to cancel your order.\nWe apologize for any inconvenience this may cause and thank you in advance for your cooperation.\n\nhttps://photos.app.goo.gl/F9RjZghzbmoKnfK47", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "similar_creators": [{"id": 28092, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "すずか", "screen_name": "k_szk", "avatar_url": "https://proxy.misskeyusercontent.jp/avatar/media.misskeyusercontent.jp%2Fio%2Fa8a3b56e-b7f2-48b1-9b39-ec0b494ea6b4.gif?avatar=1", "header_url": "https://media.misskeyusercontent.jp/io/29ee94a0-e2c7-41b4-8949-726b7aec7bcd.gif", "appeal_receivable": true, "popular_creator_rank": 2, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 7, "skills": [{"genre": "video"}, {"genre": "art"}], "nc": 160}, {"id": 2058381, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "いかお", "screen_name": "ika_zatta", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1701748456627503104/YTojphCs.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1439228259804139520/1720357215/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "nc": 1}, {"id": 2689352, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "夜みち︎", "screen_name": "yo_mi_chi000", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/185557901622240